*.phar

# NOTE: sportspress-league-manager/build/ is intentionally tracked (committed)
# so the release zip ships a working dashboard and CI can verify the artifacts.
# It must NOT be gitignored — an ignore entry here silently drops rebuilt
# bundles from `git add`, shipping a stale dashboard. Rebuild with `npm run
# build` and commit the result.
dist/

